- Recursive DFS template — the default; clean and concise: Iterative DFS template — required when the graph is too deep for the JVM call stack: The iterative version skips post-order processing naturally — if you need pos…
- For most interview problems, recursive DFS is cleaner.
- Use iterative only when stack depth is a real concern (trees with hundreds of thousands of nodes).

