## Stage 4 — DFS in the Wild: Compilers, Game Engines, and Build Tools

- Cycle detection in Java imports: The Java compiler detects circular class dependencies using a 3-color DFS on the class dependency graph.
- A class starts as white (unvisited), turns gray (in the current DFS path), and turns black (fully explored).
