## Stage 2 — Orchestration in Code: The Axon Checkout Saga

- The saga class below is the single source of truth for the checkout workflow.
- Axon persists its fields between events, so the saga survives service restarts mid-flight without losing state.
- Key annotations: @StartSaga creates a new saga instance per trigger event.
