- Right expands unconditionally each outer iteration.
- Left shrinks only while the constraint is violated.
- Every element enters and exits exactly once.
- Worked trace on "abcabcbb" — Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters: Each "→" in left column represents one or more left-pointer advances triggered by a duplicate entry.

